  "prefLabel": "Site 102.47 Service list",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Site 102.47 “Service list” means a list maintained by the committee containing the names and addresses of all parties and intervenors in a proceeding and all other interested persons or groups who request to be included on the service list.\n\nSource. #10993, eff 12-16-15 (from Site 102.20)",
